Haye NAQI MAULA (a)<br>
<br>
Masoom Ke Kaandho'n Pa Janaza hai NAQI ka,<br>
Khoo'n Rota Hai Jo Chaahne Waala Hai NAQI Ka<br>
<br>
Pardes Me'n Dhaaya Gaya WO KABAE IMAA'N<br>
Duba hua is Dard Me'n Kunba hai NAQI ka,<br>
<br>
Phir ujde hain Saadat Qayamat ka hai Manzar,<br>
Ab Sar Pa Kisi Ke Kaha'n Saaya hai NAQI ka<br>
<br>
Hai'n Mehwe Buka Zer e Lahad AHMAD O HAIDAR,<br>
Aur lab Pe MASHIYYAT Ke Bhi Nauha hai NAQI ka<br>
<br>
Ummat se yu'n phir Binte PAYAMBAR hai'n Sawali,<br>
Kya Dard Hai Kyu'n Chehra Ye Neela hai NAQI ka <br>
<br>
Sar peet te aaye hai'n Sabhi saakin e Jannat<br>
Gham Arsh e Mualla pa bhi chhaya hai NAQI ka <br>
<br>
Dil Chaak Jigar Chaak Hai is Gham ki Sina'n se<br>
ZAHRA se to puchche koi Gham Kya hai NAQI ka<br>
<br>
Kaise Na Andhero'n me'n Jahaa'n Gharq ho saara<br>
Haye Noor hi Duniya se Jab Uth ta hai NAQI ka,<br>
<br>
Sab Khaak basar Nauha kuna Ahle 'Wila' hai'n <br>
Masroof e Aza saara Zamana hai Naqi ka...<br>
<br>
- Wila Hallauri -